Subject: [PATCH 5/6] enable offline W&B logging for vision nano

---
 cosmos_framework/configs/base/experiment/sft/vision_sft_nano.py | 2 +-
 .../launch_sft_generator_vision_nano_cosmosdataloader_hcu.sh    | 1 +
 ...h_sft_generator_vision_nano_cosmosdataloader_nvidia_local.sh | 1 +
 examples/launch_sft_generator_vision_nano_hcu.sh                | 1 +
